              "value": "You are preparing the final user-facing summary for a file row limit validation result.\n\nVALIDATION_RESULT: {{$context.$nodes.VALIDATE_FILE_ROW_LIMIT.$output.result}}\n\nInstructions:\n- Explain clearly that file-based inventory organization creation and plant parameter creation allow a maximum of 50 data rows per file.\n- State the uploaded file's data row count from VALIDATION_RESULT.\n- Tell the user to reduce the file to 50 or fewer data rows and upload it again.\n- Keep the response concise and user-facing.\n- Do not invent details beyond VALIDATION_RESULT."
