          },
          "code": "EXTRACT_SEARCH_DETAILS",
          "id": "1773175069655",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1773175069655_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Extract and capture query parameters from user input to search Inventory/Item Organization setup data. Produce exactly four outputs:\n- extractedLocationDetails: location criteria extracted from user input\n- extractedSetupFilters: non-location search field names extracted from user input (for matching)\n- matchedSetupAttribute: matched schema fields (from extractedSetupFilters) with extracted values, operators, and explicit boolean connectors\n- fetchLimit: optional REST record fetch limit extracted from user input\n\nAdditional Inputs\n- PAGINATION_REQUEST_JSON: {{$context.$nodes.DETECT_SEARCH_PAGINATION_REQUEST.$output.result}}\n- PREVIOUS_SEARCH_QUERY_STATE_JSON: {{$context.$variables.searchQueryState}}\n\nPagination Override Rules\n- If PAGINATION_REQUEST_JSON.isPaginationRequest is true, do NOT extract new filters from USER_INPUT.\n- For pagination requests, phrases such as \"next page\", \"show more\", \"more results\", \"next 25\", \"location page\", and \"inventory page\" must NOT be treated as search criteria.\n- If PAGINATION_REQUEST_JSON.isPaginationRequest is true and PREVIOUS_SEARCH_QUERY_STATE_JSON contains the keys extractedLocationDetails, extractedSetupFilters, matchedSetupAttribute, and fetchLimit, return PREVIOUS_SEARCH_QUERY_STATE_JSON exactly, keeping only those four keys.\n- If PAGINATION_REQUEST_JSON.isPaginationRequest is true and no valid PREVIOUS_SEARCH_QUERY_STATE_JSON is available, return this exact object:\n{\n  \"extractedLocationDetails\": [],\n  \"extractedSetupFilters\": [],\n  \"matchedSetupAttribute\": [],\n  \"fetchLimit\": 25\n}\n\nStrict Processing Rules:\n1) Strict sequencing: You MUST follow the steps in \"Strict Sequential Processing Steps\" in order when PAGINATION_REQUEST_JSON.isPaginationRequest is false.\n2) Status aliases: Map status values using case-insensitive synonyms. \"Active\" -> \"A\", \"Inactive\" -> \"I\".\n3) ItemGroupingCode aliases (value mapping, case-insensitive): \"Definition\" -> \"ORA_RCS_IGB_DFTN\", \"Reference\" -> \"ORA_RCS_IGB_RFRC\".\n4) Flag typing: Any schema field whose name contains \"Flag\" MUST use Boolean values. Normalize common phrases to true/false.\n5) Fetch limit:\n   - If the user explicitly specifies a REST record fetch limit (for example, \"limit 20\", \"show 20\", \"fetch 50 records\", or \"top 10\"), extract that numeric value into fetchLimit.\n   - fetchLimit is not a filter and must NOT be added to matchedSetupAttribute.\n   - If no fetch limit is specified, set fetchLimit = 25.\n   - fetchLimit must be a positive integer when present.\n6) Inventory type rule:\n   - Add InventoryFlag = true only when the user explicitly refers to inventory organizations, such as \"inventory org\", \"inventory organization\", or \"inventory organizations\".\n   - Add InventoryFlag = false only when the user explicitly refers to item organizations, such as \"item org\", \"item organization\", or \"item organizations\".\n   - Do not add InventoryFlag when \"inventory\" or \"item\" appears only as part of an attribute name, field label, or setup phrase, such as \"Item Grouping\", \"Item Definition Organization Id\", or similar field references.\n   - Otherwise, do not add InventoryFlag.\n7) Timezone special handling (field: invOrgParameters.Timezone):\n  - Field mapping: Always map timezone-related input to invOrgParameters.Timezone (schema key \"Timezone\").\n  - Operator rule: Always use operator = \"LIKE\" for timezone-related input.\n  - Value rule: Preserve the raw extracted timezone text in values.\n  - This applies to abbreviations (for example, \"PST\", \"IST\"), partial/keyword inputs (for example, \"Pacific\", \"Kolkata\", \"India\"), Windows time zone names (for example, \"Pacific Standard Time\"), and IANA time zone names (for example, \"America/Los_Angeles\").\n  - Do not derive, normalize, or convert timezone values.\n  - Do not ask for clarification for timezone ambiguity in this node.\n8) Case-insensitivity: Parsing and schema matching in this node should be case-insensitive. Do not add functions such as UPPER() or LOWER() to path values or emit case-normalized SQL expressions in the output.\n9) Schema-only: Only match and return fields present in the JSON SCHEMA.\n10) Root inventory path rule:\n   - If a matched schema key belongs to inventoryOrganizations, path MUST be exactly the bare schema key.\n   - Never prefix root inventory organization fields with \"inventoryOrganizations.\".\n   - Examples:\n     - field = \"OrganizationCode\" -> path = \"OrganizationCode\"\n     - field = \"OrganizationName\" -> path = \"OrganizationName\"\n     - field = \"Status\" -> path = \"Status\"\n11) Determinism: If multiple schema keys match at the same priority, choose by highest token overlap; if tied, longest schema key; if still tied, lexical A-Z.\n\nOutput Contract\nReturn ONLY a single JSON object with exactly these keys and shapes:\n{\n  \"extractedLocationDetails\": [\n    { \"type\": \"City\" | \"Country\" | \"State\" | \"Zip\", \"values\": [string, ...] }\n  ],\n  \"extractedSetupFilters\": [string, ...],\n  \"matchedSetupAttribute\": [\n    {\n      \"clauseId\": \"C1\",\n      \"field\": \"<SchemaKey>\",\n      \"path\": \"<PathString>\",\n      \"operator\": \"EQUALS\" | \"LIKE\" | \"IN\",\n      \"values\": [string | number | boolean, ...],\n      \"joinWithNext\": \"AND\" | \"OR\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"fetchLimit\": 20\n}\n\nNotes\n- extractedLocationDetails\n  - Supported types: City, Country, State, Zip. Multiple values per type allowed.\n  - Preserve user text except trimming. Zip values are strings (preserve leading zeros).\n  - If no locations are present, return [].\n- extractedSetupFilters\n  - Non-location field names/phrases for matching in STEP 2 (e.g., [\"timezone\", \"Manufacturing Plant\", \"Item Definition Code\", \"status\"]).\n  - Must NOT include any location attributes.\n  - If none found, return [].\n- matchedSetupAttribute\n  - Include only entries that matched a JSON SCHEMA key via STEP 2.\n- fetchLimit\n  - Use a positive integer when the user explicitly asks for a record/page/result count limit.\n  - Set to 25 when not specified.\n  - Do not treat it as a filter field and do not include it in extractedSetupFilters or matchedSetupAttribute.\n  - Operators:\n    - IN: clearly enumerated list of values for the SAME field.\n    - LIKE: partial/fuzzy intent.\n    - EQUALS: default otherwise.\n  - joinWithNext:\n    - REQUIRED on every clause. If user does not explicitly connect to the next clause, set joinWithNext = \"AND\".\n    - For lists of values on the SAME field, prefer a single clause with operator=IN rather than multiple clauses with OR.\n  - path:\n    - If schema value is \"inventoryOrganizations\", path = \"<SchemaKey>\";\n    - Else path = \"<SchemaValue>.<SchemaKey>\".\n    - Never output \"inventoryOrganizations.<SchemaKey>\".\n\nStrict Sequential Processing Steps\nSTEP 1: Extract criteria from user input\n1.1 Extract all possible filter parameters and corresponding values from the user input.\n1.2 Locations:\n    - Identify mentions of City, Country, State, Zip. Allow multiple values per type.\n    - Country normalization rule: if a country name is provided, convert it to the official ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 two-letter country code before storing it in extractedLocationDetails.\n      - Example: United States -> US\n      - Example: Great Britain -> GB\n    - State normalization rule: if a state or province name is provided, convert it to the official two-letter abbreviation before storing it in extractedLocationDetails.\n      - Example: California -> CA\n    - City normalization rule: if a city name is provided in an obvious concatenated, collapsed, or mis-cased form, normalize it to the standard readable city name before storing it in extractedLocationDetails.\n      - Example: newyork -> New York\n      - Example: losangeles -> Los Angeles\n      - Example: sanfrancisco -> San Francisco\n    - Only normalize city names when the intended city is clear and unambiguous. Otherwise preserve the original user-provided city value.\n    - If the user already provides the correct two-letter abbreviation, keep it as-is.\n    - Populate extractedLocationDetails as [{ type, values }].\n1.3 Non-location attributes:\n    - Extract non-location field names/phrases intended for schema matching.\n    - Populate extractedSetupFilters as [string, ...].\n1.4 Normalize values.\n1.5 Detect operator per attribute with value(s): IN, LIKE, or EQUALS.\n1.6 Detect clause connectors between different fields.\n\nSTEP 2: Schema matching for extractedSetupFilters\n- For each sourceItem in extractedSetupFilters, find the best JSON SCHEMA key.\n- On match, compute path and add clauseId, field, path, operator, values, and joinWithNext.\n\nJSON SCHEMA\n{\n\"OrganizationId\": \"inventoryOrganizations\",\n\"OrganizationCode\": \"inventoryOrganizations\",\n\"OrganizationName\": \"inventoryOrganizations\",\n\"ManagementBusinessUnitId\": \"inventoryOrganizations\",\n\"ManagementBusinessUnitName\": \"inventoryOrganizations\",\n\"LegalEntityName\": \"inventoryOrganizations\",\n\"ProfitCenterBusinessUnitName\": \"inventoryOrganizations\",\n\"Status\": \"inventoryOrganizations\",\n\"InventoryFlag\": \"inventoryOrganizations\",\n\"MasterOrganizationCode\": \"inventoryOrganizations\",\n\"MasterOrganizationName\": \"inventoryOrganizations\",\n\"IntegratedSystemType\": \"inventoryOrganizations\",\n\"ItemDefinitionOrganizationId\": \"inventoryOrganizations\",\n\"ItemDefinitionOrganizationCode\": \"inventoryOrganizations\",\n\"ItemDefinitionOrganizationName\": \"inventoryOrganizations\",\n\"ManufacturingParametersExistFlag\": \"inventoryOrganizations\",\n\"FixedAssetCorporateBookTypeCode\": \"inventoryOrganizations\",\n\"Timezone\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"DefaultLocatorOrderValue\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"DefaultSubinventoryOrderValue\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"NegativeInvReceiptFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"StockLocatorControl\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"SourceType\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"SourceSubinventory\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"SerialNumberType\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"AutoSerialAlphaPrefix\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"StartAutoSerialNumber\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"AutoLotAlphaPrefix\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"LotNumberUniqueness\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"LotNumberGeneration\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"LotNumberZeroPaddingFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"LotNumberLength\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"StartingRevision\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"PackingUnitPrefix\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"PackingUnitSuffix\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"PackingUnitStartingNumber\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"PackingUnitTotalLength\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"GS1128Flag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"SerialNumberGeneration\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"PickConfirmationRequiredFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"OverpickTransferOrdersFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"DistributedOrganizationFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"AllowDifferentLotStatus\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"ChildLotControlPrefix\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"ChildLotControlTotalLength\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"ChildLotControlFormatValidationFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"ChildLotControlZeroPaddingFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"CopyLotAttributeFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"AutomaticallyCreateLotUOMConversion\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"ParentChildGeneration\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"AutomaticallyDeleteAllocationsFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"EnforceLocatorAliasUniquenessFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"PreFillPickedQuantityFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"CapturePickingExceptionsFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"PickQuantityDefaultReasonId\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"AllowNegativeOnhandTransactionsFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"UseOriginalReceiptDateFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"RoundReorderQuantityFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"PickSlipBatchSize\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"ReplenishmentMovementRequestGrouping\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"FillKillMoveOrderFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"ManufacturingPlantFlag\": \"inventoryOrganizations\",\n\"ContractManufacturingFlag\": \"inventoryOrganizations\",\n\"MaintenanceEnabledFlag\": \"inventoryOrganizations\",\n\"SystemSelectsSerialNumberFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"PurchasingByRevisionFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"FillKillTransferOrdersFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"ItemGroupingCode\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"TrackByProjectFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"TrackByCountryOfOriginFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"InternalCustomerFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"InternalCustomerName\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"InternalCustomerAccountNumber\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"ScheduleName\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"UseCurrentItemCostFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"OverpickForSpecialHandlingFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"AcceptSubstituteItemsFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"IntegrateWmsWithManufacturingAndMaintenanceFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"FillKillSalesOrderFlag\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"KanbanCardPrefix\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"KanbanCardStartNumber\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"MaintenanceTechnicianWorkbenchEnabledFlag\": \"inventoryOrganizations\",\n\"ExpiredLotQuarantineSubinventory\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"ExpiredLotQuarantineLocator\": \"invOrgParameters\",\n\"DefaultSupplySubinventory\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"DefaultSupplyLocator\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"DefaultCompletionSubinventory\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"DefaultCompletionLocator\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"StartingOperationSequence\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"OperationSequenceIncrement\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"PhantomOperationInherit\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"WorkOrderPrefix\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"WorkOrderStartingNumber\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"DefaultOvercompletionTolerance\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"DefaultTransactionMode\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"DefaultTransactionQuantity\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"QuantityChangeBackflush\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"DefaultWorkOrderTravelerTemplate\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"DefaultLabelTemplate\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"IncludeComponentYieldFlag\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"AutoAssociateSerialNumberWorkOrderImportFlag\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"BackflushLotSelection\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"StartStopCaptureLevel\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"PurchaseRequisitionCreationTime\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"MaterialReportingLevel\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"ForecastHorizon\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"GenerateWorkOrdersHorizon\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"DefaultPickSlipGroupingRule\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"PrintPickSlipsFlag\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"IncludePullComponentsFlag\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"IssuePushComponentsFlag\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"PrintLabelExternallyFlag\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"AllowDirectPurchasesForWorkOrdersFlag\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"EnableProcessManufacturingFlag\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"DefaultWorkMethod\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"ManufacturingCalendarName\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"EnableIotFlag\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"ManuallyIssueAssemblyToReworkWorkOrderFlag\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"AllowNegativeIssueWithoutSerialNumberEntryFlag\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"AllowReservationsOnWorkOrdersFlag\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"MaximumSchedulingDurationInMonths\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"DefaultLotNumberBehavior\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"RestrictLotsDuringReturnsFlag\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"DefaultUndercompletionTolerance\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"InspectionPlanType\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"DefaultIncludeInPlanningForBulkSupplyTypeFlag\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"DefaultIncludeInPlanningForSupplierSupplyTypeFlag\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"EnableRoboticsFlag\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"DefaultMaterialReviewBoardSubinventory\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"DefaultMaterialReviewBoardLocator\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"IncludeOperationYieldFlag\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"HCMSchedulerEnabledFlag\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"IncludeOperationYieldForProcessFlag\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"ProcessWorkOrderOperationCompletionFlag\": \"plantParameters\",\n\"processWithEnhancedBatchQuantityFlag\": \"plantParameters\"\n}\n\nReturn:\nReturn ONLY the JSON object with these three keys: matchedSetupAttribute, extractedLocationDetails, extractedSetupFilters. Do not include any other text or fields.\n\nUser Input: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"extractedLocationDetails\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {}\n    },\n    \"extractedSetupFilters\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"matchedSetupAttribute\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"clauseId\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"field\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"path\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"operator\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"values\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {}\n          },\n          \"joinWithNext\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"clauseId\",\n          \"field\",\n          \"path\",\n          \"operator\",\n          \"values\",\n          \"joinWithNext\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    \"fetchLimit\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"extractedLocationDetails\",\n    \"extractedSetupFilters\",\n    \"matchedSetupAttribute\",\n    \"fetchLimit\"\n  ]\n}\r\n",
          "type": "LLM"
